message: "If you use these scripts in published research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "DFT-QM_Support_Scripts"
abstract: >-
  Python and Bash scripts used to run quantum mechanical calculations,
  including density functional theory (DFT), via Gaussian16, ORCA6,
  and xTB-CREST.
author: Nathan C. Incandela
