license: Apache-2.0
format for citation: Incandela, N. DFT-QM_Support_Scripts; GitHub, YEAR-SCRIPT-UPLOADED. https://github.com/nathani-cmd/DFT-QM_Support_Scripts/NAME-OF-SCRIPT-USED (accessed YYYY-MM-DD).